{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":497065,"name":"Coordinación Desarrollo de Negocios","username":"Coordinacion_Desarro","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/c/ccd318/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-21T14:52:03.745Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-497065-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-497065-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-497065-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-497065-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot Agent Computer stuck “still starting up” / unreachable for ~48–72 hours (since ~2026-09-20). Agents cannot use Shell, files, screenshots, or chat attachments. Update Agent Computer and Reset Agent Computer both failed. Same failure on phone, desktop PC, and laptop with the same account — not a single-device network/AV issue. Please server-side reprovision / recreate the Agent Computer for this account; I will not click Reset again unless asked.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-497065-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-497065-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSign in to Grok Bot as \u003ca href=\"mailto:comercial@olgroup.co\"\u003ecomercial@olgroup.co\u003c/a\u003e (Cursor Pro+ / SuperGrok Heavy linked).\u003cbr\u003e\nOpen any Bot chat and try a computer action (Shell, screenshot, or attach a file).\u003cbr\u003e\nObserve computer stuck “still starting up” / no connection; attachments fail with no connection to the computer.\u003cbr\u003e\nTry Update Agent Computer → fails.\u003cbr\u003e\nTry Reset Agent Computer → fails (reset couldn’t finish / partial state).\u003cbr\u003e\nFully quit and reopen on phone, desktop, and laptop → same error on all devices.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-497065-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-497065-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAgent Computer becomes reachable again (or support reprovisions it server-side), preserving Bots, chats, files, and logins. Update/Reset should complete or staff should recover the box without requiring more client resets.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-497065-operating-system-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-497065-operating-system-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWindows 10/11\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-497065-version-information-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-497065-version-information-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot apps on phone + desktop + laptop (please tell me if you need exact build numbers from Settings → About; issue is account Agent Computer, not one IDE build). Cursor IDE itself is not the broken surface.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-497065-for-ai-issues-which-model-did-you-use-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-497065-for-ai-issues-which-model-did-you-use-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFor AI issues: which model did you use?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eN/A — infrastructure / Agent Computer connectivity, not a model reply quality issue.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-497065-for-ai-issues-add-request-id-with-privacy-disabled-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-497065-for-ai-issues-add-request-id-with-privacy-disabled-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFor AI issues: add Request ID with privacy disabled\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eN/A — sends/attachments fail before a normal Bot turn with Request ID; happy to add any ID you specify after recovery tools are available\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-497065-additional-information-9\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-497065-additional-information-9\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAccount: \u003ca href=\"mailto:comercial@olgroup.co\"\u003ecomercial@olgroup.co\u003c/a\u003e. Timezone: America/Bogota (UTC-5). Duration ~48–72h. Workarounds in use: text-only chat + Gmail/Drive/ClickUp/Calendar connectors. Please do not ask for another Reset; requesting account-side recovery like other “starting up” cases on this forum.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-497065-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-10\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-497065-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-10\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2026-09-22T07:01:41.721Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":10,"reads":5,"readers_count":4,"score":51.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":172519,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-agent-computer-stuck-starting-up-48-72h-update-reset-failed-on-all-devices-please-reprovision","display_username":"Coordinación Desarrollo de Negocios","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":139042,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-agent-computer-stuck-starting-up-48-72h-update-reset-failed-on-all-devices-please-reprovision/1